WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open Shortcuts from Record Entry / Siri

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Touch and hold Record Entry, then choose Add to Home Screen

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Confirm the addition at the top right

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Next time, tap Record Entry on the Home Screen

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:41.700
Enter the description and amount, then tap Done to save without opening the app
